[ ] PosFilter + CId is slow. why?
    - position search is just a full-table scan on MoreGame
    - CId filter introduces indexing on Game
    - check out https://dev.mysql.com/doc/refman/5.7/en/index-hints.html
    - experiment with USE/FORCE/IGNORE INDEX
      (FORCE avoids full-table scans. But for large DBs we *prefer* a full-table scan on MoreGame :)

